// The fit rules a delivery is graded by, above the relation core: literal widening and
// adoption (`radix*`, `num*` leaves), record and list fits (`rec*`, `list*`, `rcw*`), constant
// folding at a destination (`cex*`), object-shape adapters and the inferred-return joins.
// Each answers a type or a verdict for a node the core checker has already typed.

